2 CONT
2 CONT Johan van Hoorn, adlad men ej introd von Horn, (son till Johan van Hoorn, Tab 2), född 1662-02-16 i=
2 CONT Stockholm; tog namnet efter staden Hoorn i Nord-holland; studerade i Uppsala, men fullföljde dem vid utländska lärosäten och fick medicinsk grad i Leyden 1690; förordnades till assessor i Collegium medicum 1692; stadsläkare i Stoc
2 CONC kholm 1708; adlad 1719 men ej introd och fick 1720 värdighet av arkiater; livmedikus hos drottning Ulrika Eleonora d y; † 1724-06-12 i Stockholm, begr 14/6 i Maria Eleonora kyrka (källa: Genline ID 2702.40.43600). Gift 1694 i Stoc
2 CONC kholm med Catharina Pincier(1), † 1745 i Stockholm, dotter till handlanden i Stockholm, furstlige holsteinske kommissarien Ægidius Hermansson Pincier och Catharina Isaksdotter Vogdt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan von Horn har bott på Kindstugatan 8 i Gamla stan i Stockholm. Kindstugatan 3 har ägts av Johan von Horns arvingar.
2 CONT
2 CONT =====================================================================================================
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan van Hoorn, noble but not introduced von Horn, (son of Johan van Hoorn, Tab 2), born 1662-02-16 in = Stockholm; took its name from the town of Hoorn in North Holland; studied in Uppsala, but completed them at foreign universi
2 CONC ties and received a medical degree in Leyden in 1690; was appointed assessor in the Collegium medicum 1692; city ​​doctor in Stockholm 1708; knighted in 1719 but not introduced and received in 1720 the dignity of architects; life 
2 CONC physician at Queen Ulrika Eleonora d y; † 1724-06-12 in Stockholm, begr 14/6 in Maria Eleonora church (source: Genline ID 2702.40.43600). Married 1694 in Stockholm to Catharina Pincier (1), † 1745 in Stockholm, daughter of the mer
2 CONC chant in Stockholm, princely Holstein commissioner Ægidius Hermansson Pincier and Catharina Isaksdotter Vogdt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan von Horn has lived on Kindstugatan 8 in the Old Town in Stockholm. Kindstugatan 3 was owned by Johan von Horn's heirs.
