1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Behrendt Moses ROTHENBURG, grocery. Grocery store in Hamburg and Copenhagen. Born in 1701 in Hamburg-Altona. Died July 21, 1775 in Copenhagen (Mos). ~ M. VI.33 Beile FÜRST (1704-1774). See sect. 1.3. Merchant in Ha
2 CONC mburg, where his children to be born. On March 6, 1739, he was with the Danish Royal. Ladder Letter permission to settle down and act in Denmark (is then quoted as Bernt Rat Castle "). After the treatment he has been moved to Cope
2 CONC nhagen with his family. The tax man list 1762 mentioned he and his wife and their two sons. In the directory 1772 he appears as "Rat Borg, Jew, Compagni Stræde 50". Also the mother Rechle f. Fürst lived as a widow with him. Here s
2 CONC he died d. 15 March 1752. Both are buried in Møllegade. http://tom.brondsted.dk/genextracts/?ancline&chpt=1&ged=2&sid=I10
