2 CONT von Bratt was a Swedish nobleman who, according to tradition, descended from the noble family of Bratt af Höglund . The family was ennobled and died out with Johan Jacobsson Bratt, married to Agneta Weinheim and died in 1735 in Vi
2 CONC sby without sons.
