1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Robert married Maria (Mararetha) Hoijer and with her had a son called Gabriel. According to Hellstrom, his daughter Catharina married William Helleday [SSNE 787]. When Helleday died, sometime in 1679?, Robert took 
