1 NAME Carl Rustan /Kumlien/
2 GIVN Carl Rustan
2 SURN Kumlien
2 _MARNM Kumlien
2 NICK Karl
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 6 OCT 1828
2 PLAC Härlunda församling
2 ADDR
3 CITY Skara
3 STAE Västra Götalands län
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2 APR 1905
2 ADDR
3 CITY Skövde
3 STAE Västra Götaland County
3 CTRY Sweden
1 OCCU Head Master of Skövde Grammar School
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Got his degree in 1866; The same year he started working at the Skövde Grammar School; He became the head master of that school in 1883-1893; From 1894 he had a leave of absence; and in 1898 he left his position; H
2 CONC e was awarded the RVO medal – Knight of the Royal order of Vasa; He died in Skövde 2/4 1905 of heart failure (vitae organicum cordis); He never married.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Kumlien, Carl Rustan.
2 CONT
2 CONT F. i Härlunda 6/10 1828, son av assessorn Ludvig K. och Johanna Petronella Rohdin. --Ht. 38 -- ht. 48 ö. c. n. Student i Uppsala 1850 och i Lund 1854. Kollega i Sköfde 1866; t. f. rektor ibm 1883 -93; tjänstledig fr. 1894, avsked 
2 CONC 1898. RVO.  + ogift i Sköfde 2/4 1905.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT K. R. KUMLIEN.
2 CONT
2 CONT F. d. rektorn Karl Rustan Kumlien i Sköfde, fyllde den 6 okt. 75 ar. R. blef student i Uppsala 1850, adjunkt i Skara 1864, kollega i Sköfde 1866, t. f. rektor 1883—1893, tjänstledig 1894, afsked 1898. Ordförande i drätselkammaren 
2 CONC 1873—1875, sparbanksdirektör fran 1869.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
